  "title": "TikTok Ramen",
  "description": "Get the recipe for the trending ramen seen on TikTok that's made with garlic, egg, and everything bagel seasoning instead of the instant ramen seasoning packet.",
  "authors": [
    "Sara Haas, RDN, LDN"
